# Region hubs

Follow `docs/region-hub-pattern.md`. Australia is the reference. Asia reuses the same CSS.

- Use a hub only when the chapter has two or more stay pages.
- New Zealand and the Alps skip the hub. Do not add a Europe hub until Copenhagen is a real location page.
- `RegionRhythm` shows nights per stop, not weekday ideas.
- Desktop labels name the place. Mobile keeps proportional widths plus a key; no horizontal scroll.
